  "verification": "Focused reference-image tests cover coprocessor replies, capture timing, misfire recovery and native faults. A simultaneous coil interrupt can delay crank acknowledgment. Bench and on-car validation remain required.",
  "title": "Ignition Cut",
  "user_description": "Independent ignition-cut limiter with RPM hysteresis, optional fixed injector pulse width and an optional fixed ignition angle in a configurable RPM region below the cut limit. Provides shared timing and combustion-observation recovery for Launch Control V20.",
